SUMMARY:Festival Unwind Yoga
DESCRIPTION:$10 donation suggested at the door. Limited tickets available! \nThe event is at Nourishing Heart Studio. \nStudents of all levels are welcome to join these accessible practices and are encouraged to work at their own pace. Participants may drop in or leave as they choose. Multiple teachers will be on hand to demonstrate. Lotus Festival artists are invited to participate in these yoga sessions along with Festival patrons and the general public. All voluntary donations support Lotus Blossoms Education & Outreach programs and Lotus Education and Arts Foundation. \nOrder Tickets
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/festival-unwind-yoga-2026/
LOCATION:Nourishing Heart Studio\, 582 E Hillside Dr #1\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47401\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/unwind-yoga.jpg
